OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless' and a
OL,4,A'sexual predator', prosecutors allege
OL,5,Aas rape trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe allegations, from six women, date
OL,8,Ffrom 1999-2009 - here's why the women
OL,9,Fwon't be named in our coverage
OL,11,FEarlier, arriving at court, Brand said
OL,12,Fhe felt "blessed", adding: "I feel of
OL,13,Fcourse concerned but hopeful this
OL,14,Fprocess will lead to good outcomes for
OL,15,Feverybody - that is my prayer"
OL,17,FThe trial is expected to last up to six
OL,18,Fweeks at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,19,Fcentral London
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
