OL,3,APope diagnosed with lung cancer but had
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery, Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pontiff had a "peaceful night" in
OL,7,Fthe hospital, the Vatican said on
OL,8,FWednesday morning, and he is expected
OL,9,Fto remain there for about a week.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
