OL,3,ASaudi employee charged with planting
OL,4,Arecording device in OpenAI office
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI said it had discovered a
OL,7,F"sophisticated recording device" hidden
OL,8,Fin their San Francisco office and
OL,9,Falerted the FBI. The company said it
OL,10,Fused its AI models to track that it had
OL,11,Fbeen planted by an employee.
OL,13,FProsecutors say the device, wrapped in
OL,14,Ftoilet paper, was found inserted in a
OL,15,FUSB port on the back of a TV in an
OL,16,Fexecutive conference room.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
